    "causal_summary": "`design-md-generator` is the largest and most structurally varied sk-design mode: a 3-file packet root (`SKILL.md`, `README.md`, and an `INSTALL-GUIDE.md` governed by a different template family), a 10-file `references/` root plus an `examples/` tree of 4 vendor DESIGN.md exemplars, a real TypeScript `backend/` with its own test suite, plus `assets/`, `procedures/`, `feature-catalog/`, `manual-testing-playbook/`, and `changelog/`",
